    "summary": "Long, slender container made of gourd with attached lid; used to store milk. Gourd container has single long skin strap decorated at top with string of five red plastic beads. Lid is attached on a separate skin thong. Upper part of lid made of gourd, lower part composed of coiled and bound sisal. Decorated with small plastic beads coloured green, orange and yellow. Gourd vessel has local repair worked in palm stalk fibre and palm fibre strips.",
